OL,4,Apolice if she was to blame, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FNine of those men have pleaded not
OL,7,Fguilty to sexual offences against her
OL,8,Fand are standing trial at Manchester
OL,9,FMinshull Street Crown Court.
